---
// Hero.astro (Estructura Limpia: Fondo Blanco por un lado y Foto por el otro)
---
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero-grid">
    <!-- Lado izquierdo: Fondo blanco con contenidos -->
    <div class="hero-left">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="hero-brand">
          <div class="hero-brand-logos">
            <img 
              src="/images/isologo-cpce.png" 
              alt="Consejo Profesional de Ciencias Económicas de la Provincia de Santa Fe - Cámara I" 
              class="hero-brand-isotype"
              width="46"
              height="51"
              loading="eager"
            />
            <img 
              src="/images/logo-60-anos.png" 
              alt="60 Años (1966 - 2026)" 
              class="hero-brand-anniversary"
              width="50"
              height="44"
              loading="eager"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="hero-brand-text">
            <span class="hero-brand-title">Consejo Profesional de Ciencias Económicas</span>
            <span class="hero-brand-sub">De la Provincia de Santa Fe · Cámara I</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h1 id="hero-title">
          <span class="hero-title-intro">Una comunidad profesional</span>
          <span class="hero-title-accent">que impulsa el futuro.</span>
        </h1>

        <p>
          El espacio de referencia, representación y desarrollo continuo para los profesionales y graduados en ciencias económicas de la jurisdicción.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-hero-primary" href="#servicios">
            Explorar servicios 
            <svg class="icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/>
            </svg>
          </a>

          <button class="btn btn-hero-secondary" data-dialog="matricula">
            <svg class="icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/>
              <path d="m20 20-4-4"/>
            </svg>
            Consultar matrícula
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Lado derecho: La fotografía limpia y sin degradados -->
    <div class="hero-right">
      <img 
        class="hero-img"
        src="/images/hero-profesional.jpg" 
        alt="Profesional en Ciencias Económicas en su estudio contable" 
        loading="eager"
        fetchpriority="high"
        width="1200"
        height="650"
      />
      <div class="hero-caption">Comunidad Profesional · CPCE Santa Fe</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: clamp(520px, calc(100vh - 58px), 660px);
    background: #ffffff;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.08fr 0.92fr;
    min-height: clamp(520px, calc(100vh - 58px), 660px);
    width: 100%;
  }

  .hero-left {
    background: #ffffff;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    padding: 36px 44px 48px max(24px, calc((100vw - var(--max)) / 2));
    box-sizing: border-box;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .hero-copy {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 580px;
  }

  .hero-right {
    position: relative;
    background: #F1F5F9;
    height: 100%;
    min-height: 480px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-left: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
  }

  .hero-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center top;
    display: block;
  }

  .hero-brand {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    padding: 8px 18px 8px 10px;
    background: #F8FAFC;
    border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-radius: 14px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 43, 92, 0.04);
  }

  .hero-brand-logos {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    flex: none;
  }

  .hero-brand-isotype {
    height: 48px;
    width: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
    display: block;
    background: #ffffff;
    padding: 3px 5px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0, 43, 92, 0.12);
  }

  .hero-brand-anniversary {
    height: 46px;
    width: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
    display: block;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 5px rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.30));
    transition: transform .25s ease;
  }

  .hero-brand-anniversary:hover {
    transform: translateY(-1px) scale(1.04);
  }

  .hero-brand-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .hero-brand-title {
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: #002B5C;
  }

  .hero-brand-sub {
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: #0076C0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    color: #002B5C;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .hero-title-intro {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: #00366D;
    display: block;
  }

  .hero-title-accent {
    font-family: 'Lora', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
    font-size: 52px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: #002B5C;
    display: block;
  }

  .hero-copy p {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #334155;
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    max-width: 580px;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn-hero-primary {
    background: #002B5C;
    border-color: #002B5C;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 700;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 43, 92, 0.25);
  }

  .btn-hero-primary:hover {
    background: #004085;
    border-color: #004085;
    color: #ffffff;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0, 43, 92, 0.32);
  }

  .btn-hero-secondary {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1.5px solid #002B5C;
    color: #002B5C;
    font-weight: 700;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 43, 92, 0.06);
  }

  .btn-hero-secondary:hover {
    background: #F0F7FD;
    border-color: #001B3A;
    color: #001B3A;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .hero-caption {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 3;
    bottom: 20px;
    right: 20px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #002B5C;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 43, 92, 0.15);
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 36, 71, 0.10);
  }

  @media (max-width: 850px) {
    .hero {
      min-height: auto;
    }
    .hero-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      min-height: auto;
    }
    .hero-left {
      padding: 28px 20px 36px;
      justify-content: flex-start;
    }
    .hero-right {
      height: 340px;
      min-height: 300px;
      border-left: none;
      border-top: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    }
    .hero-img {
      object-position: 50% top;
    }
    .hero-brand {
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 6px 14px 6px 8px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      max-width: 100%;
    }
    .hero-brand-isotype {
      height: 38px;
    }
    .hero-brand-anniversary {
      height: 36px;
    }
    .hero-brand-title {
      font-size: 13px;
      white-space: normal;
    }
    .hero-brand-sub {
      font-size: 11px;
      white-space: normal;
    }
    h1 {
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .hero-title-intro {
      font-size: 20px;
      line-height: 1.25;
    }
    .hero-title-accent {
      font-size: 34px;
      line-height: 1.15;
    }
    .hero-copy p {
      font-size: 14.5px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }
    .hero-caption {
      right: 14px;
      bottom: 14px;
    }
  }
</style>
